# ChromaDB stores. Each script writes its own collection directory
# (chroma_agent, chroma_app, chroma_demo, chroma_main, chroma_rag), so match the
# prefix rather than one fixed name — the earlier `data/chroma_db/` rule matched
# none of them and would have published ~8 MB of scraped article text.
data/
